  "question": "Business Requirements Description:\nParking Management System:\n1.When a vehicle enters the parking lot, the system queries available parking spaces and assigns the vehicle to an empty spot. If there are no available spots, the system returns null.\n2.When a vehicle leaves the parking lot, the system marks the parking spot used by the vehicle as empty.\nSupplementary Information:\nThe parking space table records the status of each parking space (whether it is occupied or not).\nThe entry table records the status of each entry point (whether a vehicle has entered).\nThe exit table records the status of each exit point (whether a vehicle has left).",
  "ddl": "-- Schema for database: rschema_0455\nCREATE TABLE `parking_space` (\n  `parking_space_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `space_code` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  `is_occupied` tinyint(1) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\n  `occupied_vehicle_plate` varchar(20) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `occupied_at` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`parking_space_id`),\n  UNIQUE KEY `uk_parking_space_space_code` (`space_code`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `entry_point` (\n  `entry_point_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `entry_code` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  `has_vehicle_entered` tinyint(1) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\n  `last_vehicle_plate` varchar(20) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `last_entry_time` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`entry_point_id`),\n  UNIQUE KEY `uk_entry_point_entry_code` (`entry_code`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `exit_point` (\n  `exit_point_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `exit_code` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  `has_vehicle_left` tinyint(1) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\n  `last_vehicle_plate` varchar(20) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `last_exit_time` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`exit_point_id`),\n  UNIQUE KEY `uk_exit_point_exit_code` (`exit_code`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;",
